td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">3 days after scan</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">4</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">4 days after scan</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">0.5</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x0003e;4 days after scan</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">13</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">Unknown data</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">4</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x000a0;</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">&#x000a0;</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">Total</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="." charoff="50">100</td></tr></tbody></table></table-wrap></floats-wrap></article>